                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1f5fc87-f990-349d-a13b-0135abcbd552",
                                        "entry_id": "efdf475f-b72b-3251-8b09-ffd2717593a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who redeems; one who provides redemption."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4bfe3c6-3486-450b-88df-3fc9517fc555",
                                                "sense_id": "c1f5fc87-f990-349d-a13b-0135abcbd552",
                                                "text": "However there is little doubt that Virgil did - in that very sad age of the world, an age of \"misery and massacre,\" and in common with thousands of others - look for the coming of a great 'redeemer.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa91576c-75c6-49aa-8b9a-5b22d5c10008",
                                                "sense_id": "c1f5fc87-f990-349d-a13b-0135abcbd552",
                                                "text": "But these seekers, too, are saved - by virtue of the inherited symbolic aids of society, the rites of passage, the grace-yielding sacraments, given to mankind of old by the redeemers and handed down through millenniums."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72bc3094-253f-469c-bc47-e234b3255da0",
                                                "sense_id": "c1f5fc87-f990-349d-a13b-0135abcbd552",
                                                "text": "With no experience in management, little knowledge of life in Scottish football, a dressing room to gut and replace, Gerrard is now cast in the role of Rangers' great redeemer. Whatever fate befalls him, this will not be dull."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
